WEBVTT

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:04.160
A forest where anything and everything is big

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:06.350
The Eastern Woods?

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:07.070
Yes.

00:02:07.070 --> 00:02:08.720
Why do you want to go there?

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:12.710
Luna suddenly said she wanted to go to the Eastern Woods.

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:16.890
That weird voice that only Luna could hear seemed to be callin' her.

00:02:17.390 --> 00:02:18.540
I heard a voice!

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:22.560
Nobody'd gone to the Eastern Woods yet...

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:23.970
See you later!

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:27.560
...so because it was a good opportunity, Luna, Bell, and Howard...

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:31.860
...went on an expedition to find out the true identity of the voice.

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:09.610
Luna, are you okay?

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:15.420
Bell! Oh, so we fell down that waterfall.

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:27.270
But what they found was a strange world where anythin' and everythin' was ridiculously huge.

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:33.650
It's creepy...

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:04.890
.thgir eht ot nruT

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:11.240
It may've been a close call, but thanks to that voice...

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:27.030
...somehow the three of 'em were able to get away.

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:52.500
But anyways, the more I look at it...

00:04:53.170 --> 00:04:54.990
...the creepier this place gets.

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:00.430
.daehA

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.100
What's wrong, Luna?

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:07.280
Did you sense something?

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:09.440
Which way? Which way is it from?

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:11.280
This way.

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:14.900
Let's go.

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:18.360
O-oh.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.080
It's not a monster.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:21.800
Don't surprise me like that!

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:27.700
Wait up! Don't leave me behind either!

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:32.210
I'll definitely fix it.

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:36.430
There shouldn't be anything I can't fix.

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:51.670
Does he think he can really fix it with those second-hand parts?

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:53.670
It's Shingo, so don't be so sure.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:03.130
Alright! Now, if I just put this in, it should all work.

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:09.480
Well...

00:06:11.290 --> 00:06:12.130
...how do you like this?

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:24.420
What happened to me?

00:06:24.600 --> 00:06:25.490
It's fixed!

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:26.710
Mimi!

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:29.020
Thank you, Shingo!

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:31.170
It was simple enough.

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:33.590
If she breaks again, call me any time.

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:35.350
I'll fix her up right away.

00:06:36.480 --> 00:06:38.760
Shingo really is a genius!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:40.310
You're amazing, Shingo!

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:43.930
Skipping grades?

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:48.340
Starting next year, we'll be moving you ahead two years in school.

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:50.680
Two school years ahead?

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:53.980
Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry...

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:56.150
You're doing well in everything.

00:06:56.540 --> 00:07:00.490
Truth be told, this is the first time I've seen a spectacular student like you.

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:02.340
You're the pride of our school.

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:04.430
Keep up the good work.

00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:05.830
Okay!

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:13.850
If I bring this over here...

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:16.640
There's not enough parts!

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:24.230
I want to eat a lamb calzone.

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:30.170
Ouch...

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:32.530
Does it still hurt?

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:33.780
What?

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:36.030
Just a little.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:37.540
But I'm fine.

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:38.840
Don't worry.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.220
But I still don't get it.

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:45.470
Why can't anyone but Luna hear that weird voice?

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:47.030
Even I don't know.

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:53.110
But I can feel it... it's trying to tell me something.

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.820
Trying to tell you something?

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:00.670
It's possible...

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:03.350
...this forest where anything and everything is big...

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:06.460
...may have some connection to that voice.

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:08.800
What do you mean?

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:13.770
It seems like Luna can hear the voice anywhere since we came here.

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:17.610
Up until now she couldn't hear it anywhere but the lake.

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:21.470
...raeps ehT

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:28.270
In this forest...

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:30.730
...the power of the owner of that voice...

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:33.250
...has a stronger influence.

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:38.820
.thgir eht ot nruT

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:44.240
But I mean, what connection could that have with stupidly large monsters?

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:46.000
That much I...

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:48.560
If you don't know, then don't talk about it!

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:59.050
Until those three make it back, we'll work on the field.

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:02.790
I bet they'll all be really surprised!

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:03.940
May I be excused?

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.250
You didn't eat at all.

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:09.780
I'm going to the shuttle.

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:11.040
To the shuttle?

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:14.390
I'm going to see if there are any parts I can use in the communicator.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:20.160
I'll go.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:21.810
No, I'll go.

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:23.460
I think it's better that way.

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:25.210
Please do.

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:27.240
Shingo! Wait up!

00:09:28.790 --> 00:09:29.770
I'm goin' too.

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:33.070
What happened to Shingo?

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:34.840
He's definitely acting strangely.

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:54.320
This is no sweat!

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.550
Help, I can't stop!

00:10:20.100 --> 00:10:22.500
.yaw siht ,yaw sihT

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:27.960
We've really come a long way.

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:30.660
Are you sure we're going to be okay?

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:36.430
Don't stop suddenly!

00:10:39.590 --> 00:10:40.990
What's wrong, Luna?

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:49.590
What's that?

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.680
It doesn't look natural.

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:53.950
So you mean somebody made it?

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:55.280
That much...

00:10:55.410 --> 00:10:57.480
You sure don't speak straightforwardly.

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:05.910
What's wrong, Luna?

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:08.300
My head...

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:09.670
Luna!

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:12.160
What's wrong all of a sudden?

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:14.960
It seems she's had a headache since this morning.

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:17.460
You had a headache?

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:20.650
Are you okay, Luna?

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:49.740
Luna!

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:51.310
Snap out of it!

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:03.680
Are you okay?

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:05.250
Luna!

00:12:08.690 --> 00:12:09.930
I'm fine now.

00:12:10.470 --> 00:12:11.850
You surprised us!

00:12:12.150 --> 00:12:12.850
Sorry.

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:16.880
What was that?

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:19.540
Anyways, let's get over there.

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:22.610
There might be people over there, after all.

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:23.670
Yes...

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:35.450
It's Pague!

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:41.720
Hello, Pague!

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:44.490
It's been a while. How have you been?

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:52.050
You want leaves, right? Just wait a moment.

00:12:58.140 --> 00:12:59.790
There doesn't seem to be anything.

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:04.910
Maybe I can use this.

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:08.160
Isn't it impossible?

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:13.730
That thing's so complicated it'll be trouble the moment y'put it in.

00:13:15.470 --> 00:13:16.720
Of course I know that!

00:13:18.030 --> 00:13:19.000
I know, but...

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:21.360
...there's nothing else, so what choice do I have?

00:13:21.670 --> 00:13:23.300
All this time, saying, "It's impossible, it's impossible."

00:13:23.470 --> 00:13:25.550
Finding fault in everything people do.

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:28.110
If you don't plan to help me...

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:29.240
...go home!

00:13:30.130 --> 00:13:31.220
I get it!

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:34.790
Y' don't hafta get so mad...

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:57.360
It's huge...

00:13:57.820 --> 00:14:00.170
But it looks awfully old.

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:02.860
It doesn't look like there's anyone there.

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:05.050
Maybe they moved away.

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:08.480
Well, there's monsters, so it's no wonder.

00:14:09.270 --> 00:14:10.390
Anyways, let's check it out.

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:12.770
We might find something out. Right?

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:13.510
Yes.

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:14.590
Alright!

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:17.000
We'll be able to go home to the colony!

00:14:41.990 --> 00:14:43.100
Stop that, Howard!

00:14:44.940 --> 00:14:46.110
Don't threaten it!

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:47.170
Shut up!

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:49.380
You think I'm gonna let myself get killed by a thing like this?

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:51.660
Hurry up and get out of the way!

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:00.760
Run for it!

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:03.850
Get away!

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:06.000
--Howard
--Howard!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:07.520
--Don't get separated from us!
--This way!

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:14.840
Save me!

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:17.490
Stay away!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:19.810
Papa!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:20.700
Howard!

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:33.120
--Howard!
--Howard!

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:35.460
Howard!

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:37.810
Are you okay?

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:45.430
Did I kill it?

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:48.690
I killed it?

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:55.470
I beat it! <i>I</i> beat it!

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:57.130
You both saw, right?

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:59.040
I beat this thing!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:00.250
Yes...

00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:01.590
That's it!

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:06.630
What are you doing?

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:09.660
Are you going to use it for food?

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:12.430
It's evidence that I beat this thing.

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:14.660
If I just told people so, they wouldn't believe me, right?

00:17:15.810 --> 00:17:16.880
Hey, the backpack!

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:27.110
Well, let's go.

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.190
There was another one?

00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:53.200
What? What did you say?

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:54.480
...uo hc...

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:56.740
What? I don't understand!

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:57.940
Are you okay?

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:21.290
!tuo hctaW

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:35.690
Watch out!

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:40.060
This way!

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:42.230
W-- wait up!

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:46.980
What's wrong, Pague?

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:48.260
Pague!

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:50.100
What happened, Sharla?

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:52.860
I don't know! He suddenly ran off in a hurry!

00:18:58.710 --> 00:19:00.590
I'm going to check it out.

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:01.880
Kaoru!

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:26.760
Hey, I'm spent.

00:19:31.320 --> 00:19:32.050
It's the waterfall!

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:34.230
We're saved!

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.540
Hurry up, Howard!

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:41.990
Howard, quickly!

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:45.290
You don't have to be in such a rush!

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:51.010
--Watch out!
--Watch out!

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:00.010
Kaoru!

00:20:00.190 --> 00:20:01.000
Sharla!

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:03.490
Hurry up! We can pull you!

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:05.650
Howard!

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:06.700
Move it, move it!

00:20:07.190 --> 00:20:07.860
Pague!

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:26.690
Hurry and pull us up! Papa!

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:27.780
Pague!

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:40.130
I think we're saved.

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:43.490
Serves you right!

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.430
If you're frustrated, try coming up here!

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:48.460
Scissor-handed freak!

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:55.880
Chako, try a little harder.

00:21:05.520 --> 00:21:06.830
I said more!

00:21:07.840 --> 00:21:11.610
No matter what y' say, I'm doin' my best!

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:12.510
Chako...

00:21:14.820 --> 00:21:15.680
That's it.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:24.210
This circuit was no good after all.

00:21:45.230 --> 00:21:49.060
Some civilized people were living here since ages ago!

00:21:49.300 --> 00:21:50.480
Ruins?

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:52.750
I can't say so for certain...

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:55.940
...but it definitely wasn't natural.

00:21:56.390 --> 00:21:58.320
There are people on this planet!

00:21:59.050 --> 00:22:02.070
I thought it was too old, though.

00:22:02.820 --> 00:22:06.420
Mysterious ruins in a forest where everything was gigantic.

00:22:06.930 --> 00:22:10.770
And you heard that voice from somewhere in there?

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:12.180
I think so.

00:22:12.780 --> 00:22:13.990
Let's all go there together!

00:22:14.280 --> 00:22:18.190
We might be able to meet civilized people!

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:21.420
But there's such a huge crab in the way.

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:23.430
Don't worry about that!

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:26.160
I'll show that thing who's boss!

00:22:31.190 --> 00:22:32.520
Eww, yuck!

00:22:43.190 --> 00:22:44.030
What's that?

00:22:48.490 --> 00:22:49.490
It's a machine!

00:22:54.160 --> 00:22:55.430
What does this mean?

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:07.380
What was the meaning of the machine that came from the giant crab?

00:23:07.980 --> 00:23:12.420
We don't know for sure yet, but at least we have a little hope.

00:23:13.130 --> 00:23:16.190
Shingo'd been depressed lately, but he seems to've recovered.

00:23:16.690 --> 00:23:17.670
I'nnat great?

00:23:18.400 --> 00:23:21.030
But don't push yourself too hard, okay Shingo?

00:23:22.260 --> 00:23:24.570
We all feel the same way.

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.980
Next time: I really want to go home.
